[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_31]
Muffin!

[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_31_desc]
“Muffinology” —— this book is finally published.\nThis masterpiece is compiled by dozens of muffinologists and hundreds of students and believers of the Derpy Hooves, which includes the contents of hundreds of classes, covering the history of muffins, production methods, flavors, ways of eating, etc., is a very comprehensive muffin learning material.\nIn the collector’s edition, it also includes videotapes of the contents of each class, which is the first time that Derpy Hooves taught these courses, and some behind-the-scenes, recording some interesting things of Derpy Hooves and students outside the classroom.\nOnce “Muffinology” was released, it attracted widespread attention and became a must-read for muffinology learners. It has received rave reviews.

